{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ですが、明日は\n波浪浮亭 木胡桃ちゃんとして\n過ごします！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初日！がんばります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若しゃんのてとちゃんと\nざきのまりいさんと\nまいちゅんのくくちゃんと\nひなちまのがんちゃんと\nみんなで、2度と戻ってこない\n当たり前に過ぎていくかけがえのない\n毎日を大事にして\nそんな5日間の時をかけます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見守っていてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たち5人と皆さんと\n素敵な日を過ごしましょう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じょしらくの世界に\n連れ込みます(｡・・｡)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、ゲネプロだったのですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめちゃんと\nいおりちゃんが来てくれました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2人ともありがとう！\nだいすき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/05/17/1207181/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お姉ちゃんなくくるちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/05/17/1207181/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/05/17/1207181/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみと緊張といろいろな感情で\n落ち着きがありませんが\n落ち着いて頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たのしむぞー！！！"}],"source":"archive"}